<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27519" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δισχῐδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cloven-hoofed,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσχιδής, πολυσχιδής,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				499b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cloven,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδότης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					642b29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>divided, parted,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Callistr.
					<u>Stat.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
					338
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span> Dosith.<i><span class="en">
				p.412K.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>branching,</i> of arteries, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				16.10
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
